    "intro_html":  "Somebody figured out that everything good about an egg roll is on the inside, and the wrapper is mostly a delivery vehicle. So here it is without the wrapper: ground turkey and cabbage in a soy and ginger pan sauce, served over rice. It is a fifteen minute skillet that scales to fourteen containers, and it lands at \u003cstrong\u003e568 calories and 25 grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e for about \u003cstrong\u003e$2.90\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost), which is one of the more affordable bowls in this batch.",
